   "thinking": "",
   "type": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "text": "{\"recommendation\":\"escalate\",\"explanation\":\"Minimum Unrestricted Cash at October 31, 2026 fails. The bank calculated {{fact:53d25263-b311-4585-b901-bb5e0d9e2417}} against a minimum of {{fact:9d83270b-8f7c-4f19-9827-52b53df285ea}} (headroom {{fact:d1fba6d5-34ab-40e5-a99d-0ddedf31157f}}). The borrower certified {{fact:3ebf12fc-c267-4cdd-979c-69dba2eae6b6}} and compliance. Its schedule adds the pledged collateral account to operating-account cash. Section 1.1 excludes pledged or restricted cash from Unrestricted Cash, and the October bank statement marks that account as restricted and pledged for a letter of credit. Without it, operating-account cash matches the bank's figure. Only the approved terms version is on file, and no amendment or waiver is on file. The Series B term sheet postdates the test date and is non-binding. Rerun under the approved terms, the test still fails. The breach appears real and stems from the borrower's calculation.\",\"claims\":[{\"text\":\"The agreement defines Unrestricted Cash to exclude cash that is pledged or restricted.\",\"document_id\":\"67191a39-ad10-421c-9f51-e02edde92d53\",\"page\":3,\"quote\":\"\\\"Unrestricted Cash\\\" means cash held in deposit accounts of the Borrower with\\nthe Lender, excluding any cash that is pledged, escrowed or otherwise restricted.\"},{\"text\":\"Section 6.1 sets the minimum Unrestricted Cash at each month end.\",\"document_id\":\"67191a39-ad10-421c-9f51-e02edde92d53\",\"page\":4,\"quote\":\"6.1 Minimum Unrestricted Cash. Unrestricted Cash shall not be less than $5,000,000 at any month\\nend.\"},{\"text\":\"The borrower's certificate counts the pledged collateral account in its Unrestricted Cash figure.\",\"document_id\":\"63c0531a-48d8-4ede-9b18-92a87f275eaa\",\"page\":2,\"quote\":\"Cash held in the pledged collateral account\"},{\"text\":\"The October bank statement shows the collateral account as restricted and pledged.\",\"document_id\":\"310b7145-5004-40d0-ac6f-0a592dbb6e00\",\"page\":1,\"quote\":\"The collateral account is pledged to secure a hosting lease letter of credit. Balances in restricted accounts are not available for\\nwithdrawal.\"},{\"text\":\"The Series B term sheet is non-binding.\",\"document_id\":\"cb076574-8434-4b6c-b6db-e68881187f33\",\"page\":1,\"quote\":\"This summary is non-binding except for confidentiality.\"}],\"calc_ids\":[\"6f471b56-89b0-4bdc-829f-4e4b5f8f9ac7\",\"353b53b3-227c-4e9b-a7cc-7833bfaa5cc4\"],\"missing_evidence\":[],\"suggested_tag\":\"borrower_calc_error\"}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
